{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10006_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:645450afab3af7403bd72eb47fafd0dbb5f825e4a3c38a56e92b2c76ee568d48",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c190ce0e7ad1f85cb5f7f0ded3e4de59568ec70a3c603952dec71d5988859e4c",
      "text": "那么大家，先休息一下！\n时间到了我就回来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c932a5e001e91a0e20d0081db5527121db4cd53a39ea3348042f031a21d318",
      "text": "舞蹈课辛苦了！\n休息的时候要好好补充水分哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55",
      "text": "好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e8b39dd182e0bc3138877e049bad4c94cc3759d86b83c4d92de853fc1547c6",
      "text": "昨天，我去参加了结业典礼的筹备商谈。那个时候，\n老师们让我转交一封写给各位的信哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:144131438173e6368b586fee6a74c1fd08c34f8f94cd6deebd9aaed297dd287c",
      "text": "“孩子们非常憧憬作为‘帅气大哥哥’的\nもふもふえん”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5580934f0130b45949839c52b6cf74f8789cdff3ae276ae0587bbf88bb35f684",
      "text": "“很多人都说‘长大之后想成为もふもふえん！’，\n三个人在大家心目中超级受欢迎呢”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bc7508436ef920f5f1465752e02ee1ed5cbd78ceaa3d2918ac5f028a1cd699d",
      "text": "哇啊……\n虽、虽然有点害羞，但好高兴啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a460b404bbc8aeb289748a85fe608c561dcdd15579febff760ae568fad52d67",
      "text": "既然这样，结业典礼的舞台，\n必须得帅气到极致才行了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee94908d1e12cd36dc3c7e165d5c3f20e61da99d92b06e28e7676fbdc6ccfaca",
      "text": "花音会展现出\n很多很多可爱的地方给他们看的～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eae0357a8a4effb19e5f7a985364c9da7785f5341c72b29f76f11a838177a26",
      "text": "啊，不好意思，我先离开一下。\n课程重新开始前我会回来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
